 \nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\n​ ✦ UNDISCOVERED SF San Francisco
 ’s First Night Market Is Back ​Ten years ago\, Undiscovered started th
 e trend of night markets. Now\, we return during golden hour. RSVP – FRE
 E ​This year marks a special milestone — join us as we celebrate 10 se
 asons of community\, creativity\, and cultural pride! For our second hub\,
  we are so excited to bring back UNDISCOVERED SF Season 10: the Golden Hou
 r Night Market in partnership with Victory Hall. ​Nestled in the fabled 
 Ritch Street Alley\, Victory Hall has been a cornerstone of SoMa since 190
 8 — home to the legendary 330 Ritch Nightclub and a long legacy of music
 \, community\, and culture in partnership with Deanna Sison\, a culinary t
 railblazer\, a custodian of Filipino tradition \, and an influential force
  in San Francisco’s hospitality scene. ​On October 24\, we’re honore
 d to be part of that legacy — filling Ritch Street with Filipino America
 n food\, art\, music\, and culture in the heart of the Filipino Cultural C
 orridor. #UNDSCVRDseason10 #MadewithMahal ​ ✦ Come hungry. Come ready 
 to move. Come discover. ​ ​Eat your way through the market\, shop reta
 il vendors\, catch DJ sets\, and step inside Victory Hall for a special ex
 hibition honoring the history o
LOCATION:330 Ritch St
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-golden-hour-filipino-night-market-2026-som
 a/
